{"id":"773cae915e5165f3","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-partial-value-conventions.md","title":"Partial Values and Graph Conventions","display":"df-partial-value-conventions — Partial Values and Graph Conventions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-partial-value-conventions","aliases":["73-df-partial-value-conventions"],"display":"df-partial-value-conventions — Partial Values and Graph Conventions","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§8.2, print pp. 324–336; PDF pp. 346–358; local normalized interface unless explicitly BookTM","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§7.3 and §8.8, pp. 150–152, 207–209; local graph conventions","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":8},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-partial-value-conventions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-partial-value-conventions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-value-conventions — Partial Values and Graph Conventions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§8.2, print pp. 324–336; PDF pp. 346–358; local normalized interface unless explicitly BookTM"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§7.3 and §8.8, pp. 150–152, 207–209; local graph conventions"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"8"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>背景使用集合论及有类型的类缩写；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\">\\(f,g\\)</span> 为候选函数图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in B\">\\(b\\in B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PFun}\">\\(\\operatorname{PFun}\\)</span>、部分值收敛与 Kleene 相等、以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pmin}\">\\(\\operatorname{pmin}\\)</span>。只有存在图元素时才使用普通点值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(a)\">\\(f(a)\\)</span>；带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\downarrow,\\uparrow,\\simeq\">\\(\\downarrow,\\uparrow,\\simeq\\)</span> 的式子按下列图公式消去。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>有序对、笛卡儿积和有限序列采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a> 的表示；函数图是这些有序对组成的集合，有限序列本身不与其按位置求值的函数图识别。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span>、函数图的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}\\)</span> 及自然数次序为背景集合论运算；同名函数在不同声明类型或固定环境下为独立实例，不跨类型识别。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PFun}\">\\(\\operatorname{PFun}\\)</span> 的定义对候选图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 给出；其后的收敛、发散和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\simeq\">\\(\\simeq\\)</span> 子句使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:A\\rightharpoonup B\">\\(f,g:A\\rightharpoonup B\\)</span>。点值比较只在相应收敛域内使用；定义部分函数时先给出图，而不把未定义值放在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\coloneqq\">\\(\\coloneqq\\)</span> 的右边。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}value\\text{-}conventions}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PFun}(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow f\\subseteq A\\times B\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\forall b,c\\in B\\;((a,b)\\in f\\land(a,c)\\in f\\to b=c)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}value\\text{-}conventions}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PFun}(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow f\\subseteq A\\times B\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\forall b,c\\in B\\;((a,b)\\in f\\land(a,c)\\in f\\to b=c)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}value\\text{-}conventions}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nf:A\\rightharpoonup B&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{PFun}(f,A,B),\\\\\nf(a)\\downarrow=b&amp;\\leftrightarrow(a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\downarrow&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists b\\in B\\;(a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\uparrow&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\exists b\\in B\\;(a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\simeq g(a)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(f(a)\\uparrow\\land g(a)\\uparrow\\bigr)\\lor\n\\exists b\\in B\\;((a,b)\\in f\\land(a,b)\\in g).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}value\\text{-}conventions}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nf:A\\rightharpoonup B&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{PFun}(f,A,B),\\\\\nf(a)\\downarrow=b&amp;\\leftrightarrow(a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\downarrow&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists b\\in B\\;(a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\uparrow&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\exists b\\in B\\;(a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\simeq g(a)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(f(a)\\uparrow\\land g(a)\\uparrow\\bigr)\\lor\n\\exists b\\in B\\;((a,b)\\in f\\land(a,b)\\in g).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}value\\text{-}conventions}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{pmin}\\coloneqq\n\\{(S,m)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N:\nm\\in S\\land\\forall n\\in S\\;m\\le n\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pmin}:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{pmin})=\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}value\\text{-}conventions}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{pmin}\\coloneqq\n\\{(S,m)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N:\nm\\in S\\land\\forall n\\in S\\;m\\le n\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pmin}:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{pmin})=\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空候选集不被赋予任意最小值；时间、空间和神谕时间的未停机输入保持未定义。该约定不会把部分运行代价改成总函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"有序对、笛卡儿积和有限序列采用 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]] 的表示；函数图是这些有序对组成的集合，有限序列本身不与其按位置求值的函数图识别。$\\mathcal P$、函数图的 $\\operatorname{dom}$、$\\operatorname{ran}$ 及自然数次序为背景集合论运算；同名函数在不同声明类型或固定环境下为独立实例，不跨类型识别。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"f,g","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in B","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PFun}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pmin}","display":false},{"tex":"f(a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\downarrow,\\uparrow,\\simeq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PFun}","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\simeq","display":false},{"tex":"f,g:A\\rightharpoonup B","display":false},{"tex":"\\coloneqq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}value\\text{-}conventions}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{PFun}(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow f\\subseteq A\\times B\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\forall b,c\\in B\\;((a,b)\\in f\\land(a,c)\\in f\\to b=c)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}value\\text{-}conventions}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nf:A\\rightharpoonup B&\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{PFun}(f,A,B),\\\\\nf(a)\\downarrow=b&\\leftrightarrow(a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\downarrow&\\leftrightarrow\\exists b\\in B\\;(a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\uparrow&\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\exists b\\in B\\;(a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\simeq g(a)&\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(f(a)\\uparrow\\land g(a)\\uparrow\\bigr)\\lor\n\\exists b\\in B\\;((a,b)\\in f\\land(a,b)\\in g).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}value\\text{-}conventions}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{pmin}\\coloneqq\n\\{(S,m)\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\times\\mathbb N:\nm\\in S\\land\\forall n\\in S\\;m\\le n\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pmin}:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N,\\qquad\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{pmin})=\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}","display":true}],"bytes":3297,"backlinks":[{"id":"34c08ba68aabce9a","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]"},{"id":"50c58c8a099098f6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]] 的普通编号 $\\varphi_e$ 与 $\\beta$，及 [[73-df-binary-program-coding]] 的同一有效编码包 $\\mathcal E$。$\\Phi:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N^2)$ 为候选代价图族，$\\operatorname{PFun}$ 见 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]，$\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}$ 见 [[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]。"},{"id":"d46ee2f661474682","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$M$ 为候选七元组，$\\mathsf L\\ne\\mathsf R$ 为方向标签。有限字母表和有类型类缩写见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]；部分函数图见 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]。"},{"id":"1a769cdc24b3e236","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；$s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$；$\\operatorname{HaltingRun}$ 见 [[73-df-multitape-time-bounds]]，$\\operatorname{pmin}$ 见 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]。"},{"id":"568502bf56055515","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"812a4642483884b6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8658210215541698","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pmin}$ 与收敛记号见 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]；$\\operatorname{time}_M$ 首先定义为函数图，非停机输入不属于其定义域。"},{"id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\pi_i$ 是从 $1$ 开始编号的有序元组投影；$\\mathbf T=(T_1,\\ldots,T_k)$、$\\mathbf h=(h_1,\\ldots,h_k)$。$f$ 在 $L(f)$ 中是 $\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$ 的部分函数图；$\\operatorname{PFun}$ 见 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]。"},{"id":"e8878df4beac2bd8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e1b6653dcbc23ade","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pmin}$ 及部分值记号见 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]；代价定义在且仅在所列候选集合非空的输入上。"},{"id":"0173e0f8c9568f2f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pmin}$ 与收敛记号见 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]]。定义 $\\operatorname{stime}_M$ 时不预设 $M$ 计算任何总函数；该要求仅在 $\\mathsf{FP}$ 的存在量词内出现。"},{"id":"a36ff62aa04d500e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8346a921772e7ddf","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fd9e85296ed6a24d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\Sigma^*\\rightharpoonup\\Delta^*$ 的函数图类型由 [[73-df-partial-value-conventions]] 的 $\\operatorname{PFun}$ 解释；不把任意多值关系作为部分函数。"},{"id":"995085b8741b47ae","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-partial-value-conventions|Partial Values and Graph Conventions]]"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780"]}